# ---
# why: This file names distrusted eMudhra keys.
# uses: bininfo
# how: The bininfo command reads this file with --policy.
# ---
#
# A line that starts with # is a comment.
# A blank line is ignored.
# A rule line has this shape.
# deny <id> <predicates> :: <message>
# warn <id> <predicates> :: <message>
# The preferred match key is spki.
# spki is the SHA-256 of the public key.
# A sha256 rule matches one certificate encoding.
# The same key in a cross-sign has a different certificate hash.
# An ECDSA signature can also change that hash.
# not <predicate> rejects a hit that fails the predicate.
# root matches trust material that is not a pin.
# spki-not <hex>... matches a key outside the list.
# max <count> allows that many matches.
# issuer <text> matches the issuer CN or the issuer name.
# place <name> matches a section or overlay.
# expired <time> and not-yet <time> use YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ.
# rsa-below <bits> matches a short RSA key.
# unknown-curve matches a curve this scan does not name.
# deny makes the command exit 1.
# warn keeps exit 0.
#
# The eight SPKI values are the compromised intermediate keys.
# Each key is in an eMudhra certificate and a Sectigo cross-sign.
# The PEM bytes in impacted-intermediates.json match these hashes.
# The check date is 2026-10-24.
# Source: https://emudhra.we-have-a-problem.com/impacted-intermediates.json
# Source: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2083449
# Mozilla bug 2083449 records the same eight keys.

deny em-dv-tls-g3b spki ebed6475c2c2d80fcb199f3fe8dd6e6b3ce60b77eb15d4e42c3dec0c6f5b5105 :: EM DV TLS CA - G3B key is compromised
deny em-ov-tls-g3b spki 43bffa19d6ef651451f6841e019931e96f6f2eaeff28ab4b6f1ce4576de2717b :: EM OV TLS CA - G3B key is compromised
deny em-ev-tls-g3b spki e0254c7fcdc265e2f0f8a428dabb75ab4ae039b4872d62f5ee57f0877d5a8a41 :: EM EV TLS CA - G3B key is compromised
deny em-dv-tls-g3c spki 49dd353dc2b919a3770645117d0e60c16115e7d1bc259eefe734b00ea434fe5f :: EM DV TLS CA - G3C key is compromised
deny em-ov-tls-g3c spki 63ecefee431d49523bc1136c4e72d0206a477086caf606cd5cf025686c109cf8 :: EM OV TLS CA - G3C key is compromised
deny em-ev-tls-g3c spki 5c0660a2b164910d8ff589c18e14552e9e0ec237dcefe2cb736d41a4811f81a0 :: EM EV TLS CA - G3C key is compromised
deny em-ov-cs-g3b spki ec4ffa1ad0ac88081314b7aaffef6a91f97cd57291bb5ba686c5415f5eb4f6b6 :: EM OV CS CA - G3B key is compromised
deny em-ov-cs-g3c spki 92c063d67e8f14db71d288e11266ffdaf69cbf115f7bab14f3bc2f68d25e0e30 :: EM OV CS CA - G3C key is compromised

# A leaf can name one of those issuers when the intermediate is absent.

deny issuer-em-dv-tls-g3b issuer "EM DV TLS CA - G3B" :: issuer names EM DV TLS CA - G3B
deny issuer-em-ov-tls-g3b issuer "EM OV TLS CA - G3B" :: issuer names EM OV TLS CA - G3B
deny issuer-em-ev-tls-g3b issuer "EM EV TLS CA - G3B" :: issuer names EM EV TLS CA - G3B
deny issuer-em-dv-tls-g3c issuer "EM DV TLS CA - G3C" :: issuer names EM DV TLS CA - G3C
deny issuer-em-ov-tls-g3c issuer "EM OV TLS CA - G3C" :: issuer names EM OV TLS CA - G3C
deny issuer-em-ev-tls-g3c issuer "EM EV TLS CA - G3C" :: issuer names EM EV TLS CA - G3C
deny issuer-em-ov-cs-g3b issuer "EM OV CS CA - G3B" :: issuer names EM OV CS CA - G3B
deny issuer-em-ov-cs-g3c issuer "EM OV CS CA - G3C" :: issuer names EM OV CS CA - G3C

# Root keys come from roots.json.
# The PEM bytes match these SPKI hashes.
# The check date is 2026-10-24.
# Source: https://emudhra.we-have-a-problem.com/roots.json
# emSign ECC Root CA - G3 is distrusted.
# emSign Root TLS CA - G3 and emSign Root CS CA - G3 issued the intermediates.
# Those two roots are in the Microsoft store.
# AAA Certificate Services issued the Sectigo cross-signs.

deny emsign-ecc-g3 spki 8d417db2dd8bf5e3084d1e3f196d583849d81bdd4c00c70b9d39369e96b8c782 :: emSign ECC Root CA - G3 is distrusted
warn emsign-root-tls-g3 spki c619e4780ed8e0abeda24ad732567de4383a7ea941338f6d1a7d1b49ac792fe9 :: emSign Root TLS CA - G3 issued compromised intermediates
warn emsign-root-cs-g3 spki 0a6c2b2ca5b364207954171987ac9d2178561569d8205457e77ca90c32ede282 :: emSign Root CS CA - G3 issued compromised intermediates
warn sectigo-aaa spki bd153ed7b0434f6886b17bce8bbe84ed340c7132d702a8f4fa318f756ecbd6f3 :: AAA Certificate Services cross-signed compromised keys
